      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Change RRIDSCP behavior per issue discussion\n\nThe RRIDSCP.stat only depends on RRIDSCP.rrid field. Writing 0x3 to\nRRIDSCP.op currently is ignored (no operation) but RRIDSCP.rrid can be\nupdated with the write. A write to RRIDSCP.rrid may be ignored because\nthe field is WARL. The model only accepts valid values of RRIDSCP.rrid\nfrom 0 to (HWCFG1.rrid_num-1), otherwise the written RRIDSCP.rrid is\nignored. The RRIDSCP.stat always indicates the status of effective\nRRIDSCP.rrid field. We implement read behavior of RRIDSCP in IOPMP read\ninterface.",
